  "description": "Five years since Shinbi left. Ghost vanished without a trace, and peace returned to the world. Ha-Ri, who once fought evil spirits with childhood friends, is now a police officer living a busy life. Then one day, the Ghosts sealed within ‘GAU’ break free, and the dormant disaster stirs once more...!\n\nRight now, Ha-Ri's new journey to save people begins! Right here in ‘Mystery Apartment’.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
